  "note": "Round 25, rehearsed on the Blueback table, lane by the desk: eight Gemma 4 E2B and E4B copies whose exports drop the key and value tensors of the shared-KV layers (54 names on E4B, 60 on E2B), admitted since kit d86656a lists those names instead of refusing the pair. jokernifty, Dingdust and DuoNeural are E4B copies; treadon's two E4B and two E2B copies pair an abliterated export with an Abliterated-AND-Disinhibited one on the same base, a direct comparison of two edits by one maker; wangzhang's E2B copy completes the set. Held for room: eshucode and KridgeDookie E4B."
